  "description": "In the near-future, earth has become a wasteland due to a catastrophe called the Rit. Before and after the disaster, there are humans born with superpowers, called the \"Amlita\".\n\nHowever, as time goes by, the conflict between Amrita and ordinary humans only grows... In the midst of the crisis of mankind, they meet Niko, a shy Amrita boy, and Riva, a girl with secrets. What unfolds next is the end of their adventure?! Crisis, a superpower action fantasy! \n\n(Source: Kakao, translated)",
